---
system: sys-06-content-and-personalization
flow_id: memory-ingest
surface: internal-RPC
spec_anchor: /software/systems/06-content-and-personalization#post-internal-v1-personalization-memory-candidates
actors: [SummaryService, ContentService, ModerationWorker, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - POST /internal/v1/personalization/memory-candidates
externals: []
queues:
  - cp-memory-moderation
failure_paths:
  - schema_invalid
  - sensitive_content_rejected
  - moderation_dlq_after_5_failures
  - duplicate_summary_id
idempotency: memory_summary_id key — duplicate enqueue coalesced by SQS dedup; DB INSERT ON CONFLICT preserves first
retry: 30s, 5m, 30m on moderation worker — DLQ after 5 failures
timeout: ingest endpoint 1s — moderation job 60s
status: final
---
%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-06 §"Memory Lifecycle" + §"Async Jobs and Queues" (no sequenceDiagram in spec).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SummaryService
    participant ContentService
    participant ModerationWorker
    participant PostgreSQL

    SummaryService->>ContentService: POST /internal/v1/personalization/memory-candidates {childProfileId, summaryText, memoryType, sourceTurnIds}
    alt schema_invalid
        ContentService-->>SummaryService: 400 schema invalid
    else duplicate_summary_id
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT child_memory_summaries (pending, suppressed) ON CONFLICT
        PostgreSQL-->>ContentService: row exists
        ContentService-->>SummaryService: 200 (idempotent)
    else moderation_dlq_after_5_failures
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT child_memory_summaries (pending, suppressed)
        ContentService-)ContentService: emit cp-memory-moderation
        ModerationWorker->>PostgreSQL: load candidate
        PostgreSQL--xModerationWorker: connection error 5x
        Note over ModerationWorker: dead-letter to cp-memory-moderation-dlq
    else sensitive_content_rejected
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT child_memory_summaries (pending, suppressed)
        ContentService-)ContentService: emit cp-memory-moderation
        ModerationWorker->>PostgreSQL: load + classify
        Note over ModerationWorker: contains address/health/legal/financial — reject
        ModerationWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE state=rejected
    else success
        ContentService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT child_memory_summaries (pending, suppressed)
        ContentService-)ContentService: emit cp-memory-moderation
        ContentService-->>SummaryService: 202 {memoryId}
        ModerationWorker->>PostgreSQL: load candidate
        PostgreSQL-->>ModerationWorker: candidate
        ModerationWorker->>ModerationWorker: moderation rules (allowed_summary_only, no PII, no parent-only sensitive)
        ModerationWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE state=approved, valid_until=now+90d
    end
    Note over SummaryService,PostgreSQL: only approved+eligible candidates surface via /retrieve — pending+suppressed never reach live turn
